# A schematic Civitas illa Fortis for replays. Not the real map: the wiki gives where the houses
# stand only in words ("Lavinia's house, directly south-west of the bazaar"; Victor's "directly
# south-west of the western bank"; Caius' "directly north-west of the western bank"), so the
# tiles here are made up, kept to those directions: the bazaar's citizens east, Lavinia's house
# south-west of them, Oriana by a western bank, Victor's house south-west of her and Caius' north-west.
#
# Facts:
#  - names are RuneLite's (net.runelite.api.gameval): the doors VARLAMORE_THIEVING_HOUSE_DOOR_OPEN
#    (the door while the owner is home) and _DOOR_LOCKED (the wiki's Locked Door, 51998), the
#    window _WINDOW_OPEN (the wiki's 52000), the chest _CHEST04 (52008), wardrobe _WARDROBE02
#    (52010) and jewellery case _JEWELLERY_CASE01 (52011); the citizens VARLAMORE_WEALTHY_CITIZEN_*,
#    Leo VARLAMORE_THIEVING_STREET_URCHIN_A, Lucia _HOUSE_URCHIN_C, Oriana VARLAMORE_DODGY_CHARACTER_MET
#    and the owners VARLAMORE_THIEVING_HOUSE_OWNER_1 to _3 (Lavinia, Victor, Caius)
#
#   y 3130  Caius' door (1630, 3125)
#   y 3110                   Oriana (1640, 3108)          citizens and Leo (1680-1684, 3110)
#   y 3095  Lavinia's house: window (1655, 3094), chest, wardrobe, case (1657-1662, 3092-3095)
#   y 3090                   Lavinia's door (1660, 3090)
#   y 3080  Victor's door (1625, 3080)

scene 1600 3050

at 1681 3108
# The bazaar: three citizens, Leo beside one of them.
npc VARLAMORE_WEALTHY_CITIZEN_A "Wealthy citizen" 1680 3112 as citizenA
npc VARLAMORE_WEALTHY_CITIZEN_B "Wealthy citizen" 1684 3110 as citizenB
npc VARLAMORE_WEALTHY_CITIZEN_C "Wealthy citizen" 1676 3106 as citizenC
npc VARLAMORE_THIEVING_STREET_URCHIN_A "Leo" 1685 3111 as leo
# Lavinia's house, her home.
object VARLAMORE_THIEVING_HOUSE_DOOR_OPEN 1660 3090 as lavDoor
object VARLAMORE_THIEVING_HOUSE_CHEST04 1658 3092 as lavChest
object VARLAMORE_THIEVING_HOUSE_WARDROBE02 1657 3095 as lavWardrobe
object VARLAMORE_THIEVING_HOUSE_JEWELLERY_CASE01 1662 3095 as lavCase
object VARLAMORE_THIEVING_HOUSE_WINDOW_OPEN 1655 3094 as lavWindow
npc VARLAMORE_THIEVING_HOUSE_OWNER_1 "Lavinia" 1660 3092 as lavinia
npc VARLAMORE_THIEVING_HOUSE_URCHIN_C "Lucia" 1664 3088 as lucia
# The other two houses, their owners home.
object VARLAMORE_THIEVING_HOUSE_DOOR_OPEN 1625 3080 as vicDoor
npc VARLAMORE_THIEVING_HOUSE_OWNER_2 "Victor" 1625 3082 as victor
object VARLAMORE_THIEVING_HOUSE_DOOR_OPEN 1630 3125 as caiDoor
npc VARLAMORE_THIEVING_HOUSE_OWNER_3 "Caius" 1630 3127 as caius
npc VARLAMORE_DODGY_CHARACTER_MET "Oriana" 1640 3108 as oriana
